{"1054340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Logic World", "steam_appid": 1054340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1902590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic World is a first-person sandbox simulation game that's all about digital logic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your playground to explore the  emergent complexity of binary circuits. Design, build and operate incredible logic machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create math circuitry, data storage, displays, control panels, minigames, word processors, communication networks, or anything else you can dream up. You can even invent your own computer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/b15aeb8851294f3132e09276f260b962.poster.avif?t=1766833969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/b15aeb8851294f3132e09276f260b962.webm?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/b15aeb8851294f3132e09276f260b962.mp4?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll learn about how different circuits are designed and how you can use them together to perform complex operations. Grow your skills with each completed project.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic World has many advanced building mechanics to help you quickly move a design from your brain into the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/f2f40212f91b0fecefe1d8de17211d2a.poster.avif?t=1766833969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/f2f40212f91b0fecefe1d8de17211d2a.webm?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/f2f40212f91b0fecefe1d8de17211d2a.mp4?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic World is fully multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/ecd1bea7ca82e7ed50c591aa76a2efd1.poster.avif?t=1766833969\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/ecd1bea7ca82e7ed50c591aa76a2efd1.webm?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/extras/ecd1bea7ca82e7ed50c591aa76a2efd1.mp4?t=1766833969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build in a shared world with others, create machines together, and give your friends a  tour of your latest invention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Logic -</strong> Logic World is a simulation of digital circuits, running on the same principles as real world computer chips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Performance -</strong> Assemble enormous circuits and simulate them at thousands of updates per second, with no lag!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building -</strong> Create at the speed of thought with advanced 3D building mechanics, all from a first person perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer -</strong> Build circuits yourself or collaborate with friends. Up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo World -</strong> Explore an open-ended introduction to digital logic, with tutorials, challenges, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Creation Hub -</strong> Share your designs online with the click of a button. Explore and expand on the designs of others with the click of a different button!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moddable -</strong> We ❤️ modding. Install community-made mods to expand and customize your experience, or even make your own mods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRM-Free -</strong> We believe players should have freedom over their games, which is why Logic World has no copy protection whatsoever. All online features are opt-in, and we've taken great care to make sure multiplayer works without reliance on a central server.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack -</strong> Play with circuits against a backdrop of beautiful original music to inspire you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What people say about Logic World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“In my list of favorite games this lives right next to Minecraft.”</i> ‒ <strong>Searge, Minecraft developer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“As someone who enjoys building computers with redstone, this game was tailor made for people like me.” </i>‒<strong>N00b_Asaurus, logic youtuber</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“You've possibly completely changed my career path haha. Playing Logic World has shown me my love for digital logic.” </i>‒ <strong>binaryclock03, Discord user</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream project is waiting to be built. Get Logic World today! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic World is a first-person sandbox simulation game that's all about digital logic. <