a button. Explore and expand on the designs of others with the click of a different button!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moddable -</strong> We ❤️ modding. Install community-made mods to expand and customize your experience, or even make your own mods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRM-Free -</strong> We believe players should have freedom over their games, which is why Logic World has no copy protection whatsoever. All online features are opt-in, and we've taken great care to make sure multiplayer works without reliance on a central server.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack -</strong> Play with circuits against a backdrop of beautiful original music to inspire you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What people say about Logic World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“In my list of favorite games this lives right next to Minecraft.”</i> ‒ <strong>Searge, Minecraft developer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“As someone who enjoys building computers with redstone, this game was tailor made for people like me.” </i>‒<strong>N00b_Asaurus, logic youtuber</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“You've possibly completely changed my career path haha. Playing Logic World has shown me my love for digital logic.” </i>‒ <strong>binaryclock03, Discord user</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream project is waiting to be built. Get Logic World today! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Invent a new computer! Logic World is a first-person sandbox simulation game that's all about digital logic. Play alone or with friends, design unique machines, build up layers of complexity, and experience the joy of circuits!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054340/2ef158f399cfa49ccad023a0f59018b6aa0925f2/header.jpg